  "title": "Webinar Popularity",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "company": "Snowflake",
  "premium": true,
  "question": "As a Data Analyst on Snowflake's Marketing Analytics team, you are analyzing the CRM to determine what percent of marketing touches were of type 'webinar' in April 2022. Round your percentage to the nearest integer.\n\nNote from the source: marketing touches, also known as touch points, are the brand's (Snowflake's) points of contact with customers, from start to finish.",
  "notes": [],
  "tables": [
